#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:96
msgid "query coordinator"
msgstr "查询协调器"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:98
msgid ""
"The ``query coordinator`` subcommand reads one of the MP coordinator's "
"read-only HTTP APIs and renders the reply as a metrics report — the same "
"information ``curl`` returns, but aligned into columns and with byte "
"counts and ratios already formatted. Pick the API with ``--api``; "
"everything else is optional."
msgstr "``query coordinator`` 子命令读取 MP 协调器的只读 HTTP API 之一，并将回复呈现为指标报告——与 ``curl`` 返回的信息相同，但已对齐为列，并且字节计数和比例已格式化。使用 ``--api`` 选择 API；其他所有内容都是可选的。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:108
msgid ""
"Only reads are exposed. The coordinator's mutating routes are either "
"server-to-coordinator plumbing (``POST /events``, ``POST /instances``, "
"heartbeats) or belong to a command that owns the action — quotas are "
"written with :doc:`lmcache quota <quota>`. See :doc:`/mp/coordinator` for"
" the HTTP surface itself and the meaning of each field."
msgstr "仅公开读取操作。协调器的变更路由要么是服务器到协调器的管道（``POST /events``、``POST /instances``、心跳），要么属于拥有该操作的命令——配额通过 :doc:`lmcache quota <quota>` 进行写入。有关 HTTP 接口本身及每个字段的含义，请参见 :doc:`/mp/coordinator`。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:114
msgid ""
"The default ``--url`` is ``http://127.0.0.1:9300``, matching the "
"coordinator's default port. A URL without a scheme is assumed to be "
"``http://``, and a trailing slash is ignored, so ``coordinator:9300`` and"
" ``http://coordinator:9300/`` are both accepted."
msgstr "默认的 ``--url`` 是 ``http://127.0.0.1:9300``，与协调器的默认端口相匹配。没有方案的 URL 被假定为 ``http://``，并且尾部斜杠会被忽略，因此 ``coordinator:9300`` 和 ``http://coordinator:9300/`` 都是被接受的。"

