#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:170
msgid "Fleet memory"
msgstr "舰队内存"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:172
msgid ""
"``--api usage`` is the everyday view: one row per memory compartment "
"(``tier/backend``) per server, sorted so the fullest compartment is "
"first."
msgstr "``--api usage`` 是日常视图：每个服务器每个内存区（``tier/backend``）一行，按最满的内存区优先排序。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:188
msgid "Reading the table:"
msgstr "读取表格："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:190
msgid ""
"A capacity of ``--`` and a ratio of ``unknown`` mean the server never "
"declared a capacity for that compartment — an unmeasured tier, not an "
"empty one. A ``0`` would be misleading, so it is never printed there."
msgstr "``--`` 的容量和 ``unknown`` 的比例意味着服务器从未为该隔间声明容量——这是一个未测量的层，而不是一个空的层。``0`` 会产生误导，因此不会在此处打印。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:193
msgid ""
"A compartment shared by the whole fleet (e.g. one S3 bucket behind every "
"server) is attributed to ``(fleet-shared)`` rather than to any one "
"server."
msgstr "由整个车队共享的一个隔间（例如，每个服务器后面的一个 S3 存储桶）被归因于 ``(fleet-shared)`` 而不是任何一台服务器。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:195
msgid "Numeric columns are right-aligned so sizes line up on the decimal point."
msgstr "数字列右对齐，以便大小在小数点上对齐。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:197
msgid ""
"Add ``--instance`` to narrow the report to one server. The instance id "
"must be known to the coordinator — registered, holding bytes, or having "
"declared capacity — otherwise the coordinator answers ``404`` and the "
"command exits ``1``:"
msgstr "添加 ``--instance`` 以将报告缩小到一台服务器。实例 ID 必须为协调器所知——已注册、占用字节或声明了容量——否则协调器将返回 ``404``，并且命令退出 ``1``："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:214
msgid "Fleet membership"
msgstr "舰队成员资格"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:227
msgid ""
"``--`` marks a value the server did not advertise (no MQ port, no P2P "
"URL), kept distinct from ``0`` and from an empty string."
msgstr "``--`` 标记了服务器未宣传的值（没有 MQ 端口，没有 P2P URL），与 ``0`` 和空字符串区分开。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:231
msgid "Quota and usage"
msgstr "配额和使用情况"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:233
msgid "With no ``--cache-salt``, the fleet-wide listing:"
msgstr "没有 ``--cache-salt`` 时，整个车队的列表："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:247
msgid ""
"``(default)`` is the un-salted (empty-string) tenant. ``quota set`` is "
"``no`` when no explicit quota exists for that salt — such a salt is "
"governed by ``--api quota-config`` instead, so a ``0.00`` quota column "
"there does not mean \"zero bytes allowed\"."
msgstr "``(default)`` 是未加盐（空字符串）租户。当没有该盐的显式配额时，``quota set`` 为 ``no`` — 这样的盐由 ``--api quota-config`` 管理，因此那里 ``0.00`` 的配额列并不意味着“允许零字节”。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:252
msgid "With ``--cache-salt``, one tenant:"
msgstr "使用 ``--cache-salt``，一个租户："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:267
msgid ""
"To address the un-salted tenant, pass the sentinel the HTTP API uses: "
"``--cache-salt _default``. An empty ``--cache-salt ''`` builds the path "
"``/quota/``, which does not address the empty salt."
msgstr "要处理未加盐的租户，请传递哨兵使用的 HTTP API：``--cache-salt _default``。一个空的 ``--cache-salt ''`` 会构建路径 ``/quota/``，这并不处理空盐。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:271
msgid "The default limit for salts with no explicit quota:"
msgstr "没有显式配额的盐的默认限制："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:281
msgid ""
"``none (exempt)`` means the default is unset, so unquota'd salts are "
"exempt from eviction. That is distinct from a default of ``0.0``, which "
"makes every byte under an unquota'd salt evictable. See "
":doc:`/mp/coordinator` for why a freshly restarted coordinator starts out"
" exempt."
msgstr "``none (exempt)`` 表示默认值未设置，因此未配额的盐是免于逐出的。这与默认值 ``0.0`` 不同，后者使得未配额盐下的每个字节都可以被逐出。有关新启动的协调器为何一开始是免于逐出的，请参见 :doc:`/mp/coordinator`。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:287
msgid "Key directory"
msgstr "密钥目录"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:289
msgid "Directory size, and how much of it is fragment-matchable by CacheBlend:"
msgstr "目录大小，以及 CacheBlend 可以匹配的碎片数量："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:306
msgid ""
"``Claims`` counts ``(chunk, namespace)`` pairs and ``Namespaces`` the "
"distinct ``(model, salt, world size)`` triples holding indexed content. A"
" match is only offered to a requester whose namespace claims the chunk, "
"so ``Claims`` above ``Chunks`` means tenants are sharing content — the "
"signal ``Chunks`` alone cannot give."
msgstr "``Claims`` 计数 ``(块, 命名空间)`` 对和 ``Namespaces`` 计数持有索引内容的不同 ``(模型, 盐, 世界大小)`` 三元组。只有当请求者的命名空间声称该块时，才会提供匹配，因此 ``Claims`` 在 ``Chunks`` 之上意味着租户正在共享内容 — 单独的信号 ``Chunks`` 无法提供。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:312
msgid ""
"A page of keys and their placements. ``--limit`` sets the page size "
"(default 20; the endpoint accepts 1–10000, and a value outside that range"
" is rejected by the coordinator and exits ``1``):"
msgstr "一页键及其位置。``--limit`` 设置页面大小（默认 20；该端点接受 1–10000，超出该范围的值将被协调器拒绝并退出 ``1``）："

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:328
msgid ""
"``Matching keys`` is the total in the directory, not the number of rows "
"shown. The chunk hash is truncated to 12 hex characters — enough to "
"correlate with a log line, without pushing the placements column off the "
"terminal. A placement with no owning instance (a fleet-shared backend) "
"reads as ``(shared)``. The directory is a live structure, so successive "
"pages may skip or repeat keys."
msgstr "``Matching keys`` 是目录中的总数，而不是显示的行数。块哈希被截断为 12 个十六进制字符——足以与日志行关联，而不会使放置列超出终端。没有拥有实例的放置（共享后端）显示为 ``(shared)``。目录是一个动态结构，因此连续的页面可能会跳过或重复键。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:335
msgid "Prefetch progress"
msgstr "预取进度"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:337
msgid ""
"``--api prefetch`` polls a warm prefetch submitted earlier via ``POST "
"/cache/prefetches``. Both ``--instance`` and ``--request-id`` are "
"required; omitting either exits ``2`` without issuing a request."
msgstr "``--api prefetch`` 会轮询通过 ``POST /cache/prefetches`` 提交的热预取。 ``--instance`` 和 ``--request-id`` 都是必需的；省略任一项将导致退出代码 ``2``，而不发出请求。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:351
msgid ""
"While the load is still running, only ``Status: pending`` is reported. "
"The labels come from the reply itself, so a server that adds fields will "
"show them without a CLI change."
msgstr "在负载仍在运行时，仅报告 ``Status: pending``。标签来自回复本身，因此添加字段的服务器将显示它们，而无需更改 CLI。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:357
msgid ""
"The first poll that observes completion drops the job on the MP server. "
"Polling the same ``--request-id`` again returns ``404`` and exits ``1``."
msgstr "第一个观察到完成的轮询会在 MP 服务器上删除该任务。再次轮询相同的 ``--request-id`` 会返回 ``404`` 并退出 ``1``。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:361
msgid "Prometheus metrics"
msgstr "Prometheus 指标"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:363
msgid ""
"``--api metrics`` is the one API that is not a metrics report: the "
"coordinator's ``/metrics`` body is written to stdout unchanged, so it can"
" be piped to other tools. ``--format``, ``--output``, and ``--quiet`` do "
"not apply to it."
msgstr "``--api metrics`` 是唯一一个不是指标报告的 API：协调器的 ``/metrics`` 内容未做更改地写入标准输出，因此可以通过管道传递给其他工具。 ``--format``、``--output`` 和 ``--quiet`` 不适用于它。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:383
msgid "``--api NAME``"
msgstr "``--api NAME``"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:385
msgid ""
"Which API to read. One of ``usage``, ``instances``, ``health``, "
"``directory``, ``keys``, ``quota``, ``quota-config``, ``prefetch``, "
"``metrics``."
msgstr "要读取的 API。可以是 ``usage``、``instances``、``health``、``directory``、``keys``、``quota``、``quota-config``、``prefetch``、``metrics`` 之一。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:390
msgid ""
