msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:532
msgid ""
"Reports are a formatted subset of each reply, not the whole thing. "
"``--api usage`` does not surface the ``registered`` flag, so a server "
"that deregistered while its L2 bytes survive appears in the table like "
"any other; cross-check with ``--api instances``. ``--api directory`` "
"omits the per-instance L1 key counts, and ``--api keys`` omits each key's"
" token count."
msgstr "报告是每个回复的格式化子集，而不是全部内容。``--api usage`` 不会显示 ``registered`` 标志，因此在其 L2 字节存活的情况下，注销的服务器在表中看起来与其他服务器一样；请与 ``--api instances`` 进行交叉检查。``--api directory`` 省略了每个实例的 L1 键计数，而 ``--api keys`` 省略了每个键的令牌计数。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:537
msgid ""
"``--api keys`` requests a page size only. The endpoint's ``tier``, "
"``instance_id``, ``backend``, and ``offset`` filters are not exposed — "
"``curl`` ``/directory/keys`` for those."
msgstr "``--api keys`` 仅请求页面大小。该端点的 ``tier``、``instance_id``、``backend`` 和 ``offset`` 过滤器未公开 — 使用 ``curl`` ``/directory/keys`` 获取这些信息。"

#: ../../source/cli/query.rst:540
msgid ""
"``--api quota`` reports the L2 tier, which is the tier quotas are "
"enforced on. The endpoint's ``tier`` parameter is not exposed."
msgstr "``--api quota`` 报告 L2 层级，这是实施配额的层级。该端点的 ``tier`` 参数未公开。"

